Fighters!

Today we’ve released Update 0.53.12 in which we implemented in-game shop, credits, account inventory, and the possibility to buy new character slots and Premium status!

[h1]In-game shop and Credits[/h1]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30821281/1463b729a04727f2ac7db05dad9f694307a9738b.jpg[/img]

Credits – is a new currency, which can be bought on Steam and used for purchasing items in the in-game shop, premium status, and buying additional character slots.
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30821281/fd6a450eafa1d7263ec2c781ec43c7015c13a2ed.jpg[/img]

All bought items can be received by using the Account Inventory. Click a specific button in the window of your inventory to open the Account Inventory as on the screenshot below.
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30821281/95ff07296266a8f250e952b2ddd7aa5e007a58f9.jpg[/img]

Thus, you can receive all bought items in any place and now there is no need to go to the Black Market Trader to get purchased items.

Moreover, the availability of the Premium Status allows not only to get purchased items from the Account Inventory but to put them back too (excluding tokens and paint sprays). Thereby, players get a possibility to convey paid items not only between characters but between servers as well.

[b]Please launch the game via Steam for the correct work of the in-game shop.[/b]

[h1]Premium-Status[/h1]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/30821281/db0d4856095668045dd1b921a32878ca0fa0c770.jpg[/img]

Activation of Premium-Status occurs in the special section of the in-game shop. Having Premium Status gives players the following benefits:
[list]
[*] Possibility not only to take but to put bought items into the account inventory;
[*] Increased chance of the loot dropping from monsters by 30%;
[*] Increased chance of the loot dropping from NPC by 30%;
[*] Increased chance of the loot dropping from the boxes and etc. by 10%;
[*] Increased gaining experience by 15%;
[*] Increased weapon usage experience, equipment, repair and medicine experience by 30%.
[/list]
[h1]Purchasing of additional character slots[/h1]
In this version added a possibility to purchase additional character slots. To buy an additional slot, you need to top up your credit balance and buy an additional slot in the character selection menu.

Pay attention, that purchasing of a character slot extends to the entire account, and additional character slots will be available on all servers.
[h2]Other changes[/h2]
[list]
[*] Such equipment, like forcefield jammer, now can be taken only by his owner;
[*] Solved a bug due to it was possible to shoot without any sound when uses “Hide weapon” button;
[*] Solved a bug with multiple notifications on leaving a safe zone;
[*] New recipe: gas grenades;
[*] Smoke and gas grenades can be sold on commission shop now;
[*] Solved a rare bug with saving items (ammo) on commission in cases, when players add items to the existing lot;
[*] Fixed a bug with lacking ambient sound on the “Forestry” and “Minaev’s territories” locations;
[*] Added many different sounds of environment (and we will continue to work on it in the next updates);
[*] Fixed a rare bug occurred on No-PK servers when the No-PK zone didn’t turn off even when characters leave NO-PK Zone, and due to this bug, PvP became completely disabled.
[/list]

[h1]Thanks to the Founders[/h1]

All players who have received the status of “Founder” will receive 800 credits to the account balance in the game as a thank.

Thus, in connection with transition to Free-To-Play, the “Founders” received:
[list]
[*] Special status and identification in the game;
[*] Possibility to create up to 4 characters for free;
[*] 800 credits on account balance when in-game shop implemented;
[/list]

Thank you, everyone, for your support!

Yours, WTLTeam.

