Update 0.52 is installed to servers and available for downloading. In this update you’ll have a chance to study three different locations; each of them has its own peculiarities. As well, new quests were added in this update, weapon balance was changed and new PvP game mechanics were introduced – captures of faction roadblocks.

[h1]«Exclusion zone» Location[/h1]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/30821281/4627116682ed4d2ab4c2a189878109de54c1d7aa.jpg[/img]

Dead wasteland full of anomalies. Territory with its own laws and rules. The place remains unexplored in WTL universe, and it may happen that the appearance of a large number of anomalies in this territory was caused by rich NDP-radiation…

[h1] «Canyon» Location[/h1]

[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/30821281/8890593190e96f5e1bfdbbece7e2a4ce8fe64595.jpg[/img]

This location is situated to the north-east from the «Outskirts of Solnechny» and to the east from «Swamp». Both factions clash actively for the territory of Canyons because this location is rich with resources.

In «Canyon» location you’ll have to get familiar with several types of new monsters and take part in faction war for faction fortifications – Checkpoints. Earlier we told about the checkpoints [url=https://steamcommunity.com/games/WTLOnline/announcements/detail/2461674853050599564]in details[/url]. Pay attention to the fact that the influence of reputation and PvE mode are void in this location because the location is designed mainly for PvP. For this reason, the PvE-mode will be forced to switch off when you enter this location.


