[img]https://steamcdn-a.akamaihd.net/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/30821281/9e051abf1c01ab25427196b2f3fa618cadcb8201.jpg[/img]

 «Tunnels» location is the network of underground tunnels opening onto the subway station, which was unfinished before Catastrophe happened. A small group of people succeed in finding the hiding place in these tunnels; they live there for a long time with no interruption to faction wars.
Pay attention that PvE mode is switched on in «Road to Dead city» location because fights in crawl tunnels are of no interest for us.

